---
---

<section class="signal-prototype signal-pulse" aria-labelledby="pulse-title">
  <div class="pulse-orbit pulse-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="pulse-orbit pulse-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="pulse-header">
    <span>MOISES / 2026</span>
    <span>FIELD NOTE 04</span>
  </div>
  <div class="pulse-hero">
    <p class="pulse-kicker">The signal is the system</p>
    <h2 id="pulse-title">
      Make work
      <br />
      <i>move.</i>
    </h2>
    <p class="pulse-intro">
      A four-part practice for turning taste, constraints and momentum into
      products with a pulse.
    </p>
    <div class="pulse-scroll-cue">
      <span></span> trace the path
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pulse-path" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 1600" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <path
        class="pulse-thread thread-music"
        d="M245 0 C350 160 135 260 275 395 C390 505 145 580 300 730 C390 820 225 900 360 1020 C440 1090 445 1270 500 1600"
      />
      <path
        class="pulse-thread thread-design"
        d="M405 0 C330 170 510 260 400 420 C320 540 545 610 430 760 C350 865 540 950 455 1100 C405 1190 510 1290 500 1600"
      />
      <path
        class="pulse-thread thread-engineering"
        d="M595 0 C520 180 690 260 590 420 C520 530 730 625 620 760 C540 865 690 950 575 1090 C505 1180 520 1350 500 1600"
      />
      <path
        class="pulse-thread thread-product"
        d="M755 0 C660 150 855 270 720 410 C625 510 860 625 700 755 C620 820 810 945 645 1080 C570 1145 570 1320 500 1600"
      />
      <path class="pulse-core" d="M500 1120 L500 1600" />
    </svg>
    <div class="pulse-node node-a"></div>
    <div class="pulse-node node-b"></div>
    <div class="pulse-node node-c"></div>
    <div class="pulse-node node-d"></div>
    <div class="pulse-end">
      <span>ONE PRACTICE</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pulse-cards">
    <article>
      <span class="pulse-number">01</span>
      <h3>Feel the edge.</h3>
      <p>
        Music teaches timing. Design teaches attention. Engineering teaches
        respect for the constraint.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="pulse-number">02</span>
      <h3>Find the handoff.</h3>
      <p>Product is where the signals meet someone else's actual day.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="pulse-number">03</span>
      <h3>Keep the pulse.</h3>
      <p>
        Build systems that leave room for instinct, iteration and a little
        surprise.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="pulse-bottom">
    <span>
      SCROLL POSITION <b>04—16</b>
    </span>
    <span>↑ ↓</span>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .signal-prototype {
    --pulse-bg: #e8e4db;
    --pulse-ink: #171918;
    --pulse-muted: #686d67;
    --pulse-cyan: #1685a9;
    --pulse-pink: #ba174d;
    --pulse-amber: #b57b00;
    --pulse-green: #198254;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 1900px;
    background: var(--pulse-bg);
    color: var(--pulse-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .signal-pulse:before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 50% 31%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6),
        transparent 38%
      ),
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        transparent 0 95px,
        rgba(23, 25, 24, 0.07) 96px
      );
  }
  .pulse-header,
  .pulse-bottom {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 4;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 28px clamp(24px, 7vw, 110px);
    font: 500 11px/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  .pulse-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 25, 24, 0.17);
  }
  .pulse-hero {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    width: min(760px, calc(100% - 48px));
    min-height: 610px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-top: 105px;
  }
  .pulse-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: var(--pulse-pink);
    font: 500 12px/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pulse-hero h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 900 clamp(82px, 15vw, 190px)/0.77 var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pulse-hero h2 i {
    color: var(--pulse-cyan);
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .pulse-intro {
    max-width: 31ch;
    margin: 42px 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--pulse-muted);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .pulse-scroll-cue {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 44px 0 0 8px;
    font: 500 11px/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pulse-scroll-cue span {
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--pulse-ink);
  }
  .pulse-path {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1600px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pulse-path svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .pulse-thread,
  .pulse-core {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1;
    animation: pulse-draw 1.8s cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1) forwards;
  }
  .thread-music {
    stroke: var(--pulse-cyan);
    animation-delay: 0.05s;
  }
  .thread-design {
    stroke: var(--pulse-pink);
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .thread-engineering {
    stroke: var(--pulse-amber);
    animation-delay: 0.25s;
  }
  .thread-product {
    stroke: var(--pulse-green);
    animation-delay: 0.35s;
  }
  .pulse-core {
    stroke: var(--pulse-ink);
    stroke-width: 3;
    animation-delay: 1.4s;
  }
  .pulse-node {
    position: absolute;
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pulse-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--pulse-ink);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    animation: pulse-node 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1) both;
  }
  .node-a {
    top: 395px;
    left: 27.5%;
    animation-delay: 0.65s;
  }
  .node-b {
    top: 730px;
    left: 30%;
    animation-delay: 0.82s;
  }
  .node-c {
    top: 1020px;
    left: 36%;
    animation-delay: 0.99s;
  }
  .node-d {
    top: 1080px;
    left: 64.5%;
    animation-delay: 1.15s;
  }
  .pulse-end {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1135px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(18px);
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-left: 14px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--pulse-ink);
    font: 500 11px/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  .pulse-end:before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: -5px;
    top: -4px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pulse-ink);
  }
  .pulse-cards {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    width: min(900px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 100px auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .pulse-cards article {
    min-height: 260px;
    padding: 22px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 25, 24, 0.2);
    transition:
      transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1),
      background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .pulse-cards article:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }
  .pulse-number {
    color: var(--pulse-pink);
    font: 500 11px/1 var(--font-mono);
  }
  .pulse-cards h3 {
    margin: 48px 0 12px;
    font: 700 27px/1 var(--font-body);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .pulse-cards p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--pulse-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .pulse-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 28px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(23, 25, 24, 0.17);
    padding-top: 22px;
  }
  .pulse-bottom b {
    color: var(--pulse-pink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  @keyframes pulse-draw {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes pulse-node {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.7);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .pulse-hero {
      min-height: 630px;
      padding-top: 90px;
    }
    .pulse-hero h2 {
      font-size: clamp(78px, 23vw, 140px);
    }
    .pulse-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-top: 160px;
    }
    .pulse-end {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .pulse-bottom {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pulse-thread,
    .pulse-core {
      animation: none;
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
    .pulse-node {
      animation: none;
    }
    .pulse-cards article:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
